From a9ab0f18f21ac74700f9964ba98ad03e785ff0fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:04:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: prepare the EN7580 XGS-PON MAC in O1

Route EN7580 to a separate backend inside the existing xPON module.
Reset and quiesce its 10G MAC, invalidate T-CONT/GEM/AES state,
initialize MIB/GPIDX tables with bounded waits and expose read-only
debugfs status. Keep automatic upstream replies disabled and generic
XPON registration down. PHY/PMA, authenticated activation, OMCI
transport and FE/QDMA integration remain unimplemented; legacy GPON and
EPON paths are preserved.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
